  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0052_a33e29e7a664.png\"><br />In case of balanced Wheatstone Bridge\n$\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{V_{A B}}{V_{A D}}=\\frac{V_{B C}}{V_{C D}} \\Rightarrow \\frac{12}{6+x}=\\frac{0.5}{0.5} \\\\\n& x=6 \\Omega\n\\end{aligned}$"
